<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-chamaeleo-calyptratus-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Holocene Chamaeleo calyptratus Turing wavelength at 260.4 µm (Pass 1) — MorphoEval overall 81.4/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Schnakenberg kinetics on a periodic flank patch, diffusivities solved so the most-unstable wavelength is 260.4 µm, with Dv_y/Dv_x = 0.42 so the unstable modes are anteroposterior. Self-test: analytical λ = 260.55 µm, saturated field λ = 254.3 µm, stripe anisotropy 17.3, sweep Pearson r = 0.999, dispersion Pearson r = 0.998, equal-diffusion ablation ratio 1.9e-4. The GIF opens on the noisy field and ends on the H. Zell photograph; the simulated bars are not visible in the last frame. Overall 81.4/100 (faithfulness 80.0, reproducibility 84.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 86, Morphological realism / specimen match 70, Parameter expressivity 84, Morphometric validation 86, Source and data traceability 88, Code-to-model traceability 82, Reproducibility package 84. Output judged: docs/media/chamaeleo_calyptratus_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-chamaeleo-calyptratus-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 1124181 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 44f97b41f6edc702418d905ea824339625902c960ca19e586e171063b5194057 (sha256 44f97b41f6edc702418d905ea824339625902c960ca19e586e171063b5194057), spec_fingerprint 6475b1431772fac61c5a57dfa5cde945b3400d8a6722139a1e4cfa44c65c4959. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 6475b1431772fac61c5a57dfa5cde945b3400d8a6722139a1e4cfa44c65c4959; artifact_sha256: 44f97b41f6edc702418d905ea824339625902c960ca19e586e171063b5194057. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion relation and Murray 1981 wavenumber for a two-species reaction-diffusion system. | Schnakenberg 1979 kinetics du/dt = Du lap u + A - u + u^2 v, dv/dt = Dv lap v + B - u^2 v. | Ligon & McGraw 2013: male Chamaeleo calyptratus change lateral stripe brightness during contests. | Teyssier et al. 2015: chameleon skin has a tunable guanine-nanocrystal iridophore lattice. The animals in that study are panther chameleons (Furcifer pardalis); the reported spacing is of order 100 nm.; reconstructed_in_script: A = 0.062, B = 1.150, supercritical factor 1.45, and Dv_y/Dv_x = 0.42, chosen so λ_c sits on the 260.4 µm slot scale and the pattern is a vertical bar. | The 80 µm predecessor cutoff and the 10-wavelength (2.604 mm) successor envelope. The chronoseries has one Holocene point at 0 Ma.; transfer_boundary: Dermal chromatophore anatomy is transferred from the panther-chameleon study to C. calyptratus. The 260.4 µm carrier is the slot scale, not a number reported by Ligon or Teyssier.; does_not_claim: Does not claim a calibrated micrometre measurement from the Wikimedia photograph, which has no scale bar. | Does not claim the guanine lattice spacing is 260.4 µm. | Does not claim a second independent assessor.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'GIF frame 12 is the unmodified photograph, so the selected bars are not visible at the end of the animation. Composite the saturated field onto the flank and keep the enclosure.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Saturation mask still includes rock above the dorsum and a sand sliver. Restrict the orientation metric to a flank ROI.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': 'The GIF caption uses a lambda glyph the default bitmap font cannot draw.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R4', 'item': 'Single assessor. Left open; a second provider was not available in this run.'}" ;
    pk:hasScore 8.14e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-chamaeleo-calyptratus-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
